# #2009 (epic #2002): this file used to force-include the built React webapp
# bundle (`recursive-include coord/dashboard/webapp/dist *`) into the sdist
# and wheel, because `dist/` was gitignored and setuptools' VCS discovery
# could not find it. That source moved to the `coord-web` repo, so there is
# no bundle to include and no `npm run build` step in publish.yml to produce
# one. A built bundle now reaches a daemon host via
# `deploy/coord-web-dist-build.sh` -> `~/coord-web-dist` -> `coord web
# --dist` (docs/ADR_COORD_WEB_DIST.md, #2004), deliberately decoupled from
# this package's release cadence.
#
# Kept as an (otherwise empty) file so the removal is legible rather than
# looking like a directive someone dropped by accident.
